# --- corpus-sweep (added 2026-08-13) ---------------------------------------
# How many shipped `data/corpus/**/*.json` records the corpus-literal
# byte-equality sweep put through a real comparison. A FLOOR, same direction
# and same reason as the test counts: the population growing is fine, the
# population silently shrinking is the failure this repo has actually
# suffered. Lowering it to make a red tree green would mean records stopped
# being compared, which is the finding, not the fix.
#
# The population is records whose `source.kind` is `lst_token` and which carry
# a `data.raw_tokens` array — the ones with a corpus literal to compare
# against at all. Records citing `web_second_source`, `lst_corrected_ingest`,
# `lst_inherited_copy` or `same_book_fallback` are honestly out of it rather
# than counted as passes.
#
# MEASURED 2026-08-13 on tranche/9 — see the stage's own log line for the
# token/digest counts that go with it:
#   $ CARGO_TARGET_DIR=... cargo run --locked --bin corpus_literal_sweep
#
# RAISED 2026-08-16, SD31-W3-INTEGRATE-001 (post 5-branch merge, full gate VERIFY_EXIT=0):
# 5148 -> 6331, from the gate's own BASELINE NOTES block
# (docs/release/SD-31-corpus-closure-grind/artifacts/SD31-W3-INTEGRATE-001-verify.log). +1183,
# dominated by the spell lane's 1,173 newly-`raw_tokens`-enriched records.
#
# RAISED AGAIN 2026-08-16, SD31-E6-F9-001: 6331 -> 21038, from THIS cycle's own full-gate
# `corpus-sweep` stage (VERIFY_EXIT=0, 23/23 stages,
# docs/release/SD-31-corpus-closure-grind/artifacts/SD31-E6-F9-001-verify.log — "21038 records
# examined of 24116 read"). **This baseline was left stale across several intervening merged
# integration cycles** (`SD31-PI-REPAIR-001`, `SD31-E6-F5-002`'s equipment_gap enrichment,
# `SD31-E6-F2-002`'s spell citation repair, `SD31-W4-INTEGRATE-001`) whose own raw_tokens work
# already pushed the real examined-count well past 6331 before this cycle started — confirmed:
# this cycle's OWN pre-enrichment measurement, at the merged tip before writing a single new
# `raw_tokens` field, was already 19,422 (`corpus_literal_sweep --json-out` run before this
# cycle's `enrich_monster_ability_raw_tokens` ran). Of the full +14,707 jump, **+1,616 is this
# cycle's own** (`enrich_monster_ability_raw_tokens.rs`'s real, byte-verified additions to
# `monster_ability`); the remaining +13,091 is prior cycles' already-landed, never-recorded work
# — not re-attributed to any one of them within this cycle's remaining budget, reported honestly
# as a gap in this baseline's own maintenance discipline rather than silently absorbed.
# SD31-W5-INTEGRATE-001, 2026-08-16: 21038 -> 21716 measured (this cycle's own run 2 corpus-sweep
# stage: "21716 records examined of 24736 read... 0 findings"). Floor only ever raises.
#
# RAISED AGAIN 2026-08-16, SD31-E6-F2-004: 21716 -> 22937 measured (this cycle's own full-gate
# `corpus-sweep` stage, VERIFY_EXIT=0: "22937 records examined of 24736 read... 0 findings").
# +1221, exactly this cycle's `enrich_monster_raw_tokens.rs` enrichment count (1221 monster
# records newly carrying `data.raw_tokens`) -- fully attributed, no unexplained residue.
#
# RAISED AGAIN 2026-08-16, SD31-W6-INTEGRATE-001 (integration cycle, full gate VERIFY_EXIT=0):
# 22937 -> 23859 measured ("23859 records examined of 24736 read... 0 findings"). +922, exactly
# SD31-E6-F7-001's `enrich_companion_raw_tokens.rs` count (922 companion records newly carrying
# `data.raw_tokens`) -- fully attributed. Note the equipment-repair lane's own +39/-39 round trip
# (SD31-E6-F5-004 re-cited 39 records without re-enriching, shrinking the population by 39; this
# integration cycle ran `enrich_equipment_raw_tokens` to restore it) nets to zero here and does
# not appear as a separate delta.
#
# RAISED AGAIN 2026-08-16, SD31-E6-F2-005 (spell/race_trait cycle, full gate VERIFY_EXIT=0):
# 23859 -> 24519 measured ("24519 records examined of 25396 read... 0 findings"). +660, exactly
# `cache_gen::spell_lane_dump`'s own count (660 new spell corpus JSON records across
# occult_adventures/ultimate_magic/ultimate_combat/ultimate_intrigue, each enriched with
# `raw_tokens` by the same cycle's widened `enrich_spell_raw_tokens.rs`) -- fully attributed.
